# Content changes

English, first person, plain. No emoji in titles. Do not invent credits, lyrics, dates, or ratings. Look them up. Do not commit unless asked.

## Media lists

Edit `_data/books.yml`, `music.yml`, `movies.yml`, or `games.yml`. Put the entry in the matching `years` group (`label: YYYY`), **newest date first**. Use `current:` only for in-progress books/games.

Shared fields: `title`, Wikipedia `url` when it exists, `date` (YYYY-MM-DD, the day Stefano finished/listened/watched/played), `rating` (1–5), `year` (work year), `genres` (lowercase; quote keys like `"R&B"`). Optional `cover:` when Wikipedia has no usable page image: a file under `assets/images/covers/` (e.g. `/assets/images/covers/isola-di-arturo.jpg`) or a full `https://` URL. Do not invent covers.

- Books: `authors: [{name, url}]`, `language`
- Music: `artists: [{name, url}]`. Mark singles with `subtitles: [Single]` (shown on the list, skipped in yearly stats).
- Movies: `creators: [{name, url}]` (director), `language`
- Games: `developers`, `publishers`, `console: {name, url}`. Same title with ending names in `subtitles` counts as one game in stats. Give DLC its own title (or `subtitles: [DLC]`) so it counts as a different game.

Copy the surrounding YAML shape. Do not invent people or links.

## Posts

`_posts/YYYY-MM-DD-slug.markdown`. Filename date = front-matter date.

```yaml
layout: post
title:  "Title without emoji"
date:   YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS +0100
icon: name          # required if the post is not tied to a project
categories: one-or-more
tags: [blog]        # one or more of: blog, dublin, software, music, project, games
```

- Tags: `blog`, `dublin`, `software`, `music`, `project`, `games`.
- Project write-up: `categories` must include that project's `category` (see `_data/projects.yml`). The post then uses the green portfolio icon via `post-label.html`. Project-specific icons stay on the portfolio page.
- Standalone post: set `icon:` (e.g. `music`, `website`).
- Thought / opinion post: `icon: pencil`, `categories: thoughts`. Do not also add a project category, or the project icon wins.
- Voice matches `_posts/2026-08-16-rebuilding-this-site.markdown` and `_posts/2026-07-03-magia-bianca.markdown`.
- Cursor-authored posts end with `{% include made-with-cursor.html %}` (`— Made with [icon-cursor] Cursor`, muted, right-aligned). `icon-cursor` is the hexagon + arrow cutout, not a mouse pointer.

### Album / listen post (see Magia Bianca)

Order: personal opener → cover (`assets/images/posts/`, `.album-cover`) → Stefano's favorites → `<aside class="album-facts">` with label `Album information` (facts only, smaller muted text) → `.listen-links` (Spotify, YouTube Music, Apple Music) → made-with.

Date = the `date` already in `music.yml` for that album. Quote published lyrics only. Verify streaming URLs; do not invent YouTube Music album IDs.

## Projects

Add a block to `_data/projects.yml`. If `section` is new, also add the `assign` + `##` heading in `portfolio.markdown`.

Required: `slug`, `section` (`flagship` | `libraries` | `plugin` | `interpreters` | `web` | `games`), `category` (must match related posts), `icon`, `name`, `why` (one line), `description` (`>` markdown), `links`, `tags`. Optional: `screenshot`, `screenshot_alt`, `emoji`, `version`, `marketplace_plugin_id`, `marketplace_widget` (`install` uses a theme-aware local button; `card` uses the JetBrains embed).

Related posts are automatic when `post.categories` contains `project.category`.

## Icons

New mark: `<symbol id="icon-NAME" viewBox="0 0 24 24">` in `_includes/icons.svg`. Prefer the site stroke style (`currentColor`, width 1.75). Use `{% include icon.html name="NAME" %}`.

Give it an unused color in `assets/main.scss` next to the other `.icon.icon-*` rules.

Taken: mappa `#2dd4bf`, todo `#f4b942`, prettycode `#a78bfa`, blocchi `#60a5fa`, fifteen `#fb923c`, tictactoe `#fb7185`, connectfour `#facc15`, turing `#ef4444`, brainfuck `#e879f9`, eml `#34d399`, treeshade `#4ade80`, website `#f43f5e`, portfolio-in-posts `#22c55e`, music-in-posts `#f472b6`, pencil-in-posts `#e07a5f`, spotify `#1ed760`, youtube-music `#ff0033`, apple-music `#fc3c44`.

- Project / global: `.icon.icon-NAME { color: #...; }`
- Post-only (keep nav brand): `.post-title .icon.icon-NAME, .post-link .icon.icon-NAME`
- Music and website post icons: not green or blue
